# Pairs with NoStaleAuthority. The subscription acknowledges the new epoch
# before (here: without) marking the snapshot out of date, so the advance
# completes while the peer still trusts its old snapshot.
MODULE: DeliverWithoutObserve
TARGET: NoStaleAuthority
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a silo acknowledges a push without marking its snapshot out of date
PERTURBS: Deliver

--- FIND
    /\ knows' = [knows EXCEPT ![t] = TRUE]
    /\ stale' = [stale EXCEPT ![t] = stale[t] \/ Superseded(t)]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the push is not observed.
    /\ knows' = [knows EXCEPT ![t] = TRUE]
    /\ stale' = stale
--- END
